# Pairs with RetainedRestorable. Production before the fix (#5357): a pass
# deleted every manifest outside the policy's keep set and its listed base
# closure, without looking for an increment built on it that the listing did
# not hold yet. An increment that passed its check before the row was removed
# is then published on a deleted base.
MODULE: RetainedRestorableNoDependentScan
TARGET: RetainedRestorable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the pass never scans the sink for increments built on a doomed manifest
PERTURBS: Scan

--- FIND
    /\ prBlocked' = [prBlocked EXCEPT ![p] = Blocked(p)]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: no dependent scan.
    /\ prBlocked' = [prBlocked EXCEPT ![p] = {}]
--- END